"personaname": "Balk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/balkio/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 122794, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 658, "playtime_at_review": 113936, "last_played": 1789436720, "avatar": "4dafa5726c8db346fe5df77d7aa19bc8271c2191"}, "language": "english", "review": "There was a time and place where I would have this as a massive \"Would not recommend\". At some point in time, though, they put someone in charge that ACTUALLY plays the game on a normal, non-developer account and they pumped out QoL changes left and right. I didn't believe it at first, but I am not immune to propaganda and gave the game another go after having been baited back in by the Chroma Zunlong skin. I can safely say that it's almost an entirely different game from what it once was with Rebecca at the helm and I found myself actually having fun with Warframe again, a statement that I would have laughed at like 5 years ago.\n\nNew player experience still kinda sucks though, as I have heard from some of my friends who just started getting into the game recently, but DE's acknowledged that to be a pain point that they're working away at. If you're a veteran thinking about coming back, though, now's a pretty good time to do so. If you're a newbie with some friends and a decent tolerance for ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥, maybe consider giving it a go. Be a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ space ninja. Save the Origin System, one mass grave at a time.", "timestamp_created": 1748734095, "timestamp_updated": 1748734095, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}